WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:05.120
Kia ora and welcome to Splash Palace! In
celebration of Māori Language Week

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.220
come learn this phrase with us.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.720
Āhea ka timata te puna ngaru?

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.360
Did you guess what that meant?

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.760
What time does the wave pool start?

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.920
Come in and try on one of our friendly
staff!

